Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.43,0:05:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第7季第20集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.99,0:00:03.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.69,0:00:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克·德弗罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank Devereaux.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.02,0:00:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻子加疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a jackass and a lunatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是个监控专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is also a surveillance expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.62,0:00:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克 好好查查理查德·罗曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hey, Frank, go dig up some dirt on Richard Roman."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天晚上 我所有的IP都用报废了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That night, I was burned off every I.P. I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.95,0:00:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话有人监听 房子受到监控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ears on my phones, eyes on my house…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.06,0:00:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是迪克派人监视你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick's got people watching you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.36,0:00:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克 别开枪 我们要进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank! Don't shoot! We're coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,老弗兰克知道的太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's to say this ain't the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.06,0:00:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道他们今天会不会来下毒手\N{\fnArial\fs30}they come for old Frank who knew too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.83,0:00:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的时辰到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your time is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 你从死神手里逃脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby. You ran away from your reaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.31,0:00:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.29,0:00:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲍比 - 你们看的到我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bobby. - You can see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.42,0:00:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么想的 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you thinking, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.53,0:00:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还要活儿要干\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still have work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.98,0:00:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是不对的 你心里清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not right. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.75,0:00:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么想的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.18,0:00:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得我们该怎么办 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, what do you think we should do? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.23,0:00:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,世间万物都该有终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is supposed to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.84,0:00:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he was supposed…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.09,0:00:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样能有好结果吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the odds this ends well?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.11,0:00:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,能有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the odds?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.58,0:01:03.01,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.20,0:01:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 好吧 谢谢你帮忙找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I hear you. All right, well, thanks for looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.81,0:01:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.56,0:01:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺拉也看不出考古挖掘点的套路\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Nora didn't see any pattern to the dig sites either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.27,0:01:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 因为根本就没有共同之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, 'cause they got nothing in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.03,0:01:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从当地传说也没查到线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got nothing from local lore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.31,0:01:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,上上下下都查遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}50 miles in every direction of all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.40,0:01:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像那些真就只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's like they're just…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.89,0:01:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,陈年的泥巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}old dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.77,0:01:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克在找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Dick looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.14,0:01:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 小混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, go easy, you idjits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.88,0:01:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉突然冒出来吓你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry for the jump scare.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.35,0:01:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么个原理\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how does this work, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.44,0:01:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一拧开壶盖 你就像灯神一样钻出来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I leave the cap off and you just genie your way out?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.71,0:01:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有那么简单就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish it were that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.47,0:01:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is …
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.18,0:01:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 想集中注意力真难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it. It's hard to stay focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.82,0:01:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是有点累\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still kind of worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.15,0:01:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为一个死人来说 你最近相当忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been pretty busy for a dead guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.61,0:01:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:01:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道离我下次鬼休克还有多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't know how long before my next ghost nap,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.24,0:02:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以咱们就直接切入正题\N{\fnArial\fs30}so let's just skip to the skinny …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.34,0:02:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你们的那串数字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those numbers I gave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.51,0:02:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,智兹维尔那片空地吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The empty lot in Cheeseville?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.02,0:02:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里不会空太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, it ain't gonna be empty for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.08,0:02:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我瞟过一眼迪克的宏伟计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a gander at Dick's big plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.13,0:02:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在他枪杀我之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}right before he Lincolned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.69,0:02:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们准备要动工了 现在是几月\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're breaking ground … what month is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.35,0:02:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,四月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, April.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.10,0:02:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经开始动工了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ground's broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.59,0:02:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在做调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're surveying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.98,0:02:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正准备建个什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're getting ready to build something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.34,0:02:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要建什么 - 问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Build what? - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.07,0:02:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,建什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.72,0:02:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们在这抱怨的时候 他们已经在动工了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're building as we're yammering.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.93,0:02:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己去看 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out yourself. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.61,0:02:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们之所以没注意 是因为最近几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you guys missed it because you've been kind of busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.32,0:02:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一直在忙着杀鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}killing ghosts the past few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.31,0:02:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但迪克要着手经营「加工食品」\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Dick is about to get into the Soylent Green business.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.04,0:02:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,网站上显示他们要建生物技术实验室 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That site'll show you they're building a biotech lab, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.12,0:02:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,妹的的生物技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biotech my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.81,0:02:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个操蛋地方是个顶尖水准的屠宰场\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sucker is a state-of-the-art slaughterhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.62,0:02:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,人为刀俎 我们为鱼肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're the beef.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.17,0:02:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是对迪克 这也略微大胆了点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think that's a little bold, even for Dick?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.30,0:02:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说没人会发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you no one will even notice,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.59,0:02:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他首先会用火鸭鸡三明治一类的快餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause first, he's gonna dumb us all down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.95,0:02:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我们的智商拉低\N{\fnArial\fs30}with turducken-style munchies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.85,0:02:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们变得温顺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make us docile.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.50,0:02:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒物在肉里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in the meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.70,0:03:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从那次惨败之后 我们就没去过比格森\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't been to Biggerson's since that whole fiasco.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.05,0:03:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,比格森 他买下了一长串快餐店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biggerson's? He's bought a list of joints 10 pages long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.75,0:03:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来 他会帮我们治愈疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next, he's gonna cure us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cure us of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.07,0:03:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有致命性疾病 癌症 艾滋 心脏病\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the biggies … cancer, AIDS, heart disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.48,0:03:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有一处类似于干细胞研究所的机构\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just say they got an affinity for stem-cell research.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.76,0:03:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个利维坦房地产公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}The, uh, Leviathan real-estate mooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.74,0:03:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是说要建抗癌中心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}building that cancer center.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.83,0:03:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里要建科研中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to be a research center.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.28,0:03:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,研究啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Research for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.16,0:03:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经不在捕猎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not hunting anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.78,0:03:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要用基因改造创造完美的群体\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're engineering the perfect herd.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.20,0:03:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,首剂就能作用于其DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the very first dose, it starts to work on their DNA,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.63,0:03:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,减慢他们的新陈代谢 导致体重增加\N{\fnArial\fs30}slowing their metabolism, causing weight gain,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.77,0:03:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能抑制他们的情感波动\N{\fnArial\fs30}and dampening their emotional range,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.51,0:03:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们洋洋自得\N{\fnArial\fs30}which makes them perfectly complacent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.15,0:03:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对付过的不少货色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we've gone up against plenty …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.42,0:03:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢在林子里吃人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liked to eat a few folk in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.17,0:03:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次情况不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.29,0:03:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们这是要把我们从食物链最顶端踹下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about knocking us off the top of the food chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.05,0:03:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们利维坦要永远住在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about them Levis living here forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.47,0:03:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是少数人高高在上\N{\fnArial\fs30}one-percenter style,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.71,0:03:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,而把我们排挤到\N{\fnArial\fs30}while we march our dopey, fat asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.80,0:03:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在各处新建的死亡集中营里那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}down to the shiny new death camps at every corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.59,0:04:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到一封邮件\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an e-mail…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.40,0:04:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克发来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克还活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank's alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.77,0:04:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个混球 总是抢我风头\N{\fnArial\fs30}That jackass, always stealing my thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.31,0:04:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sam and Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们读到这封信 说明我已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you're reading this, I'm dead…"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.27,0:04:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者情况更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}"…or worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.87,0:04:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这封邮件是为了提醒你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}"This e-mail was sent because some prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.52,0:04:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在正有人试图黑进我的硬盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}"is trying to hack into my hard drive right this second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.79,0:04:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非那是你们 否则你们就有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So unless it's you, you got trouble."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.23,0:04:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我的硬盘里装满了机密信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay."My drive is full of compromising info.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.50,0:04:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的新化名 住所 存车地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your new aliases, hangouts, where you stored your car…"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.40,0:04:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.07,0:04:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管他对硬盘进行了层层加密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though he encrypted the crap out of his drive,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.66,0:04:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们要做好心理准备 有人最终会黑进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}he says we should assume that someone can hack into it eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.01,0:04:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在上面安装了追踪装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did put a tracking device in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.97,0:04:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 看看弗兰克的硬盘在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's see where Frank's drive is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:05:00.24,Note,0,0,0,0,,（找到硬盘 理查德·罗曼企业）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.75,0:05:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.57,0:05:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在敌人的大本营\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in the middle of the death star.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.84,0:05:24.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（五小时前）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.12,0:06:41.24,Note,0,0,0,0,,（美国保守党）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.97,0:06:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚过得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd it go last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.91,0:06:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我通过你间接体验生活是你的道义责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a moral imperative you let me live vicariously through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.34,0:06:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,无图无真相 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pictures or it didn't happen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.44,0:07:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟然在慈善活动上钓到人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hooked up at a charity benefit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果在生殖权慈善宴会上都没有艳遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can't score at a reproductive rights function,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.25,0:07:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那在别的地方也没戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you simply cannot score.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.04,0:07:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 这合法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Is that legal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.78,0:07:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是成年人 你情我愿有何不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were two consenting adults.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.72,0:07:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是指那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.61,0:07:15.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（感谢您的捐款）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.69,0:07:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要用公司电脑做违法乱纪的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you insist on breaking the law on company property?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.24,0:07:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,公司的网速比较快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm, faster internet connection here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.65,0:07:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果皮特发现了 他会炒了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, if Pete finds out, he's gonna fire you…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.02,0:07:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,或报警逮捕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or get you arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.38,0:07:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪熊皮特吗 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teddy bear Pete? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.05,0:07:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道这事我都干了一个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I've been doing this for like a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.19,0:07:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能掩盖行踪 哈利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can cover my tracks, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.77,0:07:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.65,0:07:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.80,0:07:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻来我办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}My office. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.00,0:07:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱你 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love you. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.77,0:07:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理·布兰博利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie Bradbury?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.62,0:07:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.57,0:07:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.05,0:08:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 我执掌大权的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, I've been running things for, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.05,0:08:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎比人类的历史还长\N{\fnArial\fs30}feels like since before the dawn of man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.68,0:08:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直有个梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always had a vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.33,0:08:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今我的梦想触手可及\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm close to realizing that dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.67,0:08:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我自夸 这世界就是我的餐盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to brag, but the world is my dinner plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.83,0:08:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让任何事危及我的梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't want anything to jeopardize that…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.04,0:08:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不会让一颗老鼠屎坏了一锅粥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely not the actions of one tiny, little person.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.70,0:08:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我可以处理好的 求你不要解雇我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, sir, I can fix this. Please… please don't fire me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.29,0:08:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's she talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.66,0:08:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说黑掉超政行委（美国专门负责做竞选的组织）的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that about hacking those super PACs?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.03,0:08:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause that was adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.41,0:08:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 一个高中辍学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, how does a high-school dropout.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.47,0:08:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会成为罗曼公司最聪明的人之一呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}become one of the brightest minds at Roman, Inc.?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.55,0:08:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…honestly… historically,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都看不惯当权人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had this problem with… with authority…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.30,0:08:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.96,0:08:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意识到只有尽可能成为一个不可或缺的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I realized the only way to get away with being me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.29,0:08:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能自由地做我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}was to be as indispensable as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.06,0:08:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:08:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你似乎让我的人生完整了 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kind of completing me right now, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.13,0:09:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有灵气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have that spark,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.68,0:09:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是这种灵气才让人类如此与众不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}that thing that makes humans so special.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.97,0:09:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是每个人都有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everyone has it, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.73,0:09:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有灵气的人可以被取代\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those people… they can be replaced.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.41,0:09:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但像你这样的人 是无法复制的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But people like you… are impossible to copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.71,0:09:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,复制\N{\fnArial\fs30}C-copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.74,0:09:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在夸你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.39,0:09:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西属于一个叫弗兰克·德弗罗的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This belonged to one Frank Devereaux.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.68,0:09:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得他能让这整个公司垮台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought he could bring down the whole company.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.64,0:09:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没做的 让他不能得逞吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was wrong. Let's keep him wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.51,0:09:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你们小青年怎么说 这东西加密了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's encrypted, or whatever you crazy kids say these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.72,0:09:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,破解密码然后交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break it open and bring it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.23,0:09:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我这就去办 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm on it. And… and thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.35,0:09:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.02,0:09:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有三天时间 失败的话就滚蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have three days or you're fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.59,0:09:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈话愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.69,0:09:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this real life?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.85,0:09:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克·罗曼给了我一个任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick Roman gave me an assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.52,0:09:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 好事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that…good?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说索伦之眼正盯着我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means the Eye of Sauron is on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.86,0:09:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要什么的话 我就在夏尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you need anything, I'll be back in the Shire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.94,0:10:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 小赫 只剩我们俩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, H. It's just you and me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.05,0:10:14.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拒绝访问）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.32,0:10:22.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拒绝访问）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.31,0:10:27.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拒绝访问）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.57,0:10:30.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拒绝访问）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.62,0:10:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,下盘国际象棋吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a nice game of chess?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.10,0:10:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,「战棋」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"WarGames"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.11,0:10:48.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你好猎鹰教授）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.35,0:10:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,来玩游戏吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we play a game, bitches?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.81,0:10:53.94,Title,0,0,0,0,,能比《消失的密室》难搞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was hardly the Chamber of Secrets, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.76,0:11:03.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（想得美 你个软蛋）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.53,0:11:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,要从头再来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And back to square one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.09,0:11:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看弗兰克的硬盘在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see where Frank's drive is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.61,0:11:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在敌人的大本营\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in the middle of the death star.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.22,0:11:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 去芝加哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, off to Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.51,0:11:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 孩子们 你们不能就这样闯进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait, boys, you can't just break in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.89,0:11:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们认得你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know your mugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.57,0:11:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如我们把酒瓶邮寄过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we mailed in the flask?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.17,0:11:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这个鬼能在那里通行无阻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I could ghost through the joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.82,0:11:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克又不能杀我两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's not like Dick can kill me twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.92,0:11:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你有更好的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you got a better plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.01,0:11:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 就因为我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Just because I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.43,0:11:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不代表我不知道怎么干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean I don't know how to do my damn job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.18,0:11:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 那是迪克的办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, that's Dick's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.82,0:11:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜萨姆是想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think what Sam's trying to say is,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.53,0:11:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你遇上迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}what happens if you run into Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.37,0:11:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,想找他报仇 怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, you know… go vengeful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.27,0:11:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是你说放下就能放下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it's not something you can just shake off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.89,0:11:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 稍稍信任我一点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Give me some credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.18,0:12:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我就应该坐冷板凳干着急吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, I'm supposed to just ride the pine?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.53,0:12:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.29,0:12:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚回家了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you go home last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去倒两杯咖啡来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get us some coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.43,0:12:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,估计你那杯会想加点可卡因吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume you want some crack in yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.84,0:12:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.31,0:12:39.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（允许访问）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.96,0:12:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,总算好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.57,0:12:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this d-bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.02,0:12:53.37,Note,0,0,0,0,,（理查德·罗曼企业）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.86,0:12:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别手贱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.20,0:12:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼说直接交给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman said to bring it right to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.17,0:13:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 小赫 你总是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right, H. You're always right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.52,0:13:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,利维坦是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the frak's a Leviathan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.55,0:13:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,「关于利维坦 你需要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The thing to know about Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.27,0:13:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些怪物十分古老\N{\fnArial\fs30}is these monsters are as old as time,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.78,0:13:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是最强大的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}strong as all get-out…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.59,0:13:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,硼酸钠 也就是硼砂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sodium borate… commonly known as borax.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.52,0:13:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键是砍头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decapitation is the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.45,0:13:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把头放进盒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then put that head in a box.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.74,0:13:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是怪物中的战斗机\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are the superman of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.45,0:13:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来自于炼狱黑洞 - 有本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- from the black hole of purgatory. - …send it to the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.55,0:13:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,送去月亮上\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.38,0:13:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它们可以变形 - 如果能杀死他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "They can shapeshift, - If they die…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.53,0:13:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拥有你的脸 - 也肯定不易\N{\fnArial\fs30}- take your face, - they don't die easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.78,0:13:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的记忆 与你相关的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}your memory … the works.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.93,0:13:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大是迪克·罗曼先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The top boss is Mr. Dick Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.91,0:13:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是最高指挥「\N{\fnArial\fs30}He runs the show."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.01,0:13:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,「割伤它们就会看到黑色胶状物\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Cut one, you see black goo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.19,0:13:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是掉进了奇境\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're through the looking glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.53,0:13:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,血是黑的 黑的就是血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood is black, and black is blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.97,0:14:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't turn your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.03,0:14:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃离你所在的楼 逃出国「\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the building. Get out of the county."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.65,0:14:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How goes it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.69,0:14:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定是花了一整天时间黑进了疯人院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty sure I spent the last 24 hours hacking into a loony bin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.13,0:14:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮特呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Pete?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.21,0:14:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能溜到车库去抽烟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, probably snuck down to the garage for a smoky treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.42,0:14:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,硬盘进展如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going with that drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.41,0:14:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.72,0:14:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理整晚都待在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie was here all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.01,0:14:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个硬盘对我很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, that drive's very important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.50,0:14:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得安排人替我看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna want a watchful eye kept.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.44,0:14:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你看着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I will do just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.02,0:14:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.48,0:14:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯·斯普林斯汀（歌手）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce Springsteen,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.35,0:14:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莱·曼宁（橄榄球选手） 我们的小查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eli Manning, our own little Charlie…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.46,0:14:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法取代的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irreplaceable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.75,0:14:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你充其量就是蒂姆·蒂博（橄榄球选手）\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're more of a Tim Tebow,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.24,0:14:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔·拜登（奥巴马竞选对手）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toe Biden type.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.38,0:14:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,身上没有灵气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got no spark in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.52,0:14:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 你一无是处\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, there's nothing in you…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.51,0:15:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能做达里尔的晚餐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}except Daryl's dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.05,0:15:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮特 抱歉没说一声就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Pete, sorry I left without telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.16,0:15:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 就是有些不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I just wasn't… feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.80,0:15:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是 女人的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a…lady thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.67,0:15:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明天一早就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be in first thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.44,0:15:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,挂了哦 肚子疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to go… cramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.05,0:15:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 我不会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. I'm not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.32,0:15:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远点 你们个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from me, you…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.00,0:15:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,易形者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shapeshifter!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.21,0:15:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是易形者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're not shapeshifters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.87,0:16:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,娘亲啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.86,0:16:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're not Leviathans, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我们证明吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want us to prove it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.61,0:16:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道硼砂能给他们造成什么伤害吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what borax does to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.17,0:16:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.31,0:16:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.09,0:16:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.04,0:16:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.86,0:17:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是说 你们是斩妖除魔的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you are saying you guys're the monster hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.61,0:17:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是说 还有其他的妖怪喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, there are other monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.26,0:17:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说 算了 当我没问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. Never mind. Just shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.10,0:17:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我知道你们是怎么找到这个硬盘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I get how you tracked the drive …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.77,0:17:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过GPS 可那个硬盘还在办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}straight GPS … but it's still at the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.61,0:17:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.06,0:17:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 居然黑了我的网络摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw! Son of a gun jacked my webcam?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.85,0:17:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克就这德行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.70,0:17:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还真厉害得吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's creepy, I'll give it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.29,0:17:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是说 他盘上的东西全是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're telling me everything he had on his drive is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.76,0:17:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且远不止这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.39,0:17:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你花了多久破解掉弗兰克的盘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. How long did it take you to crack into Frank's drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.71,0:17:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多一天吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A day or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.44,0:17:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么是你破解不掉的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything you can't hack into?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.45,0:17:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,迄今还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.19,0:17:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克·罗曼的电子邮件呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about Dick Roman's E-mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.56,0:17:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.08,0:17:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也是其中之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. He's one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.16,0:17:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准确 他是大Boss\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Uh, he's their leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.26,0:17:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's the end game …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.48,0:17:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷走我们的资源 把我们变成奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}steal our resources, make us some slaves?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.46,0:17:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,全球超值套餐 我们就是那个「餐」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Planet-wide value meal. We're the meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.53,0:18:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是…开玩笑的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be…serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.93,0:18:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right. Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.81,0:18:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要查什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.70,0:18:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,先查查关于考古挖掘点的内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, for starters, uh, anything about archaeological dig sites.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.17,0:18:12.73,Title,0,0,0,0,,《夺宝奇兵》的那种吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Indiana Jones stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.73,0:18:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只知道迪克把整个地球都挖了个遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we know is that Dick has been digging all over the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.02,0:18:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要知道他在找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we need to know what he's looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.40,0:18:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说 我这周还蛮顺利的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I was having a really good week.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.44,0:18:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我遇到个人 还下载了罗宾的新专辑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I met someone, downloaded the new Robyn album.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.05,0:18:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以说顺风顺水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything was coming up me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.79,0:18:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道这很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we get it sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.36,0:18:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是那个 是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not that. This.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.08,0:18:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克的电子邮件不在公司的服务器上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick's E-mail isn't on the company server.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.17,0:18:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他办公室的私人服务器上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's on a private one, in his office.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.37,0:18:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.94,0:18:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你有他的电话或者就在他的办公室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't get in it unless you have his phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.84,0:18:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然进不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you're at his desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.58,0:18:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说如果我们能进去迪克的办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're saying that if we're inside Dick's office,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.29,0:18:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能黑进他的电子邮件\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we can hack into his E-mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.77,0:18:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不行 除非像…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't. Only someone like…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.40,0:18:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,打死我都不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I sure as hell ain't doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.77,0:18:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是本分地工作…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am doing my job and…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.19,0:18:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,硬盘上的东西我全看过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the chances I see everything on that drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克会留我活口吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Dick lets me live anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.74,0:18:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.38,0:19:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就删掉硬盘上的东西 好保护我们三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I erase the drive first, protect me and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.56,0:19:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后继续过我的小日子 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I go back to my old life, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.99,0:19:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 没那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It's not that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.02,0:19:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经被迪克盯上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on Dick's radar,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.30,0:19:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说你没有小日子可继续了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means you don't have an old life anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.39,0:19:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.22,0:19:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初该去谷歌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have taken that job at Google.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.65,0:19:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 查理 如果你不干也没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Charlie, it's okay if you can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.92,0:19:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又不是你想做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you didn't volunteer for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.17,0:19:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全没有 一点没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.42,0:19:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我现在想做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I volunteer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.92,0:19:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我也得回去删掉弗兰克硬盘上的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to go back in anyways to wipe Frank's drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.18,0:19:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就顺便闯下迪克的办公室好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might as well break into Dick's office, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.61,0:19:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.00,0:19:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不确定 可这些怪物会吃掉我认识的所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. But these things are gonna eat everyone I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.30,0:19:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋才袖手旁观呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of douche bag stands by for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.59,0:19:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说回来 在现实生活中我从没有闯过\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, I have never broken into anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.27,0:19:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何地方 那…有什么计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}in real life before, so…plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.56,0:19:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有蓝牙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a bluetooth?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.70,0:19:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.51,0:19:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能进入安全系统吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security system … can you get into that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.45,0:19:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能随意控制我们需要的任何监控摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can reroute any surveillance cameras we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.52,0:20:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 那我们就从那个入手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's start with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.69,0:20:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有进入大楼的出入卡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a key card to get in the building?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.34,0:20:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,算有吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.47,0:20:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法复制出入卡 但我能伪造磁条\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't duplicate it, but I can make a fake backing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.37,0:20:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,进展如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.53,0:20:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 她把什么都搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, since she set all this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.08,0:20:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快过来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.39,0:20:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没\N{\fnArial\fs30}See this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.28,0:20:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能让每个监视器循环播放事先录好的画面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can put each camera on a prerecorded loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.26,0:20:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的话 她就能有十五分钟时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once I do that, she'll have 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.48,0:20:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,十五分钟时间又不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}15 minutes ain't a lot of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.90,0:20:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.63,0:20:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说如果黑进他的台式机要超过一刻钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said if it took longer to hack his desktop,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.27,0:20:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她活该被吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}then she deserved to be eaten.
