Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.29,0:20:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.92,0:20:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你觉得他是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Y-you think he …
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.31,0:20:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们让他别妄动 他却搭了个顺风车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hitched a ride after we told him to cool his jets?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.02,0:20:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. What the hell's he thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.64,0:20:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没好好想\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.49,0:20:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们怎么办 取消行动吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do we do … call the whole thing off?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.03,0:20:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就这一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only got one shot at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.54,0:21:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 我是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, it's Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.47,0:21:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在唱歌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you singing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.77,0:21:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一紧张就会唱歌 别对我指手画脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sing when I'm nervous. Don't judge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.81,0:21:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judgment-free zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.01,0:21:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 看下你背包边上的口袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, uh, check the side pocket in your bag.
