Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.54,0:21:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,真贴心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm. Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.94,0:21:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.38,0:21:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个东西差不多是个传家宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, that's, uh, kind of a family heirloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.06,0:21:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个好运符 你可别丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good-luck charm, okay, so don't lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.81,0:21:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.28,0:21:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.49,0:21:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始行动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.05,0:21:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.84,0:21:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.66,0:21:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我动不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm having a hard time moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.65,0:21:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.92,0:21:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我我不是间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I'm … I'm not a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.58,0:21:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我办不到 我办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't do it. I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.78,0:21:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我办不到 我不行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do it. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.81,0:21:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 查理 我是萨姆 - 对不起 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Charlie, hey, it's Sam. - I'm sorry, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.00,0:21:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 我只是 - 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. I-I just … - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.49,0:21:57.86,Title,0,0,0,0,,听着 《哈利波特》里面你最喜欢谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, listen, w-who's your favorite "Harry Potter" character?
