Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.29,0:22:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会 当然不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.70,0:22:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did she do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.47,0:22:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会击败困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}She kicked ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.54,0:22:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上几乎在每本书里都是她救了哈利\N{\fnArial\fs30}She actually saves Harry in practically every book.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.76,0:22:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可她最终却跟… - 回到正题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And then she ends up with the wrong … - Uh, stay on track.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.05,0:22:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说 她会击败困难 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so she kicked ass, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.57,0:22:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你会怎么做呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, then, what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.44,0:22:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,击败困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kick it in the ass.
