Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.03,0:22:37.90,Title,0,0,0,0,,你真行 邓布利呆（借用《哈利波特》里Dumbledo校长的名字）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you go, Dumble-dork.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.80,0:23:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in.
