Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.69,0:23:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,快行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.04,0:23:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿有个大块头保安 堵住了去路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there's a big-ass guard up here, blocking the door.
