Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.89,0:24:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wait him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.53,0:24:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他是不准备走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.27,0:24:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你每天都在那儿上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh, you work there every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.21,0:24:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你应该认识他吧 - 算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Doyouknow the guy? - I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.87,0:24:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过他 但是没有讲过话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I've seen him. I've never talked to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.73,0:24:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 那么你们打照面时 他是盯着你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, when you've seen him, does he look at you,
