Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.70,0:24:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在帮倒忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.49,0:24:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想想 你有没有纹身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Um… do you have any tattoos?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.09,0:24:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,露出来给他瞧上一眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him a little sneak peek there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.89,0:24:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,纹身总是性感的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All tattoos are sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.34,0:24:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我纹的是穿奴隶比基尼的莉亚公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine is princess leia in a slave bikini.
