Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.35,0:25:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.83,0:25:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象你刚回到家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just got home,
