Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.14,0:25:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 比尔 我是信息部的查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey…Bill. Charlie from I.T.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.42,0:25:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,通宵工作呢 辛苦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Burning the midnight oil, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.70,0:25:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不也是嘛 你是不是总泡健身馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like you … I mean, when you're not at the gym.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.92,0:25:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看着像把休息时间都花在健身上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, do you work out with all your free time?
