Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.35,0:25:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话我没说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}This never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.58,0:25:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你平时都做些什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you ever do anything else with your free time,
