Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.85,0:25:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你平时都做些什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do anything else with your free time,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.72,0:25:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 带不带女孩子去喝酒啊 - 别笑了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- like take a girl out for a drink? - Stop laughing, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.91,0:25:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别笑了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop laughing, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.23,0:25:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道那个酒吧吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…y-you don't know that bar …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.33,0:26:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别笑了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop Laughing Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.97,0:26:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那地方棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That place is bringing sexy back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.43,0:26:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别说了 查理 - 挺方便的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop talking, Charlie! - Which is easy,
