Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.83,0:26:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有空我们出去喝一杯怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, um, y-you were saying about going out, drinks?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.03,0:26:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好啊 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…yeah, yeah. That'd be great.
