Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.64,0:26:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我个忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can I ask you a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.21,0:26:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼下的女厕所脏死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ladies' room downstairs is nasty.
