Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.49,0:26:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先挂电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going radio-silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.47,0:26:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来的时候告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us know when you're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.20,0:26:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就干等吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, guess we just wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.47,0:26:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.27,0:27:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的密码是「痣在逼得」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your password is "w1nn1ng" with two 1's?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.83,0:27:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我是绝地大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Let's Yoda this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.49,0:28:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.68,0:28:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.12,0:28:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说左边的第一个房间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said first door on the left, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.62,0:28:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是右边第一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I said first door on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.31,0:28:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真傻 我太健忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Silly me. I am always forgetting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.32,0:28:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我忘了干什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what else I forgot to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.24,0:28:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你我的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give you my phone number.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.54,0:28:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不该进这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we really shouldn't be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.85,0:28:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼先生不喜欢别人进他的办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Roman doesn't like people in his office.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.57,0:28:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须的 你看过他的厕所吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure. Have you seen his bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.96,0:28:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.00,0:28:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.73,0:29:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这多「棒」啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.87,0:29:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后咱们改变一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? New plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.91,0:29:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始 我们就呆车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on, we just stay in the van.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.04,0:29:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,派一个小妹子去替我们办事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and send in the 90-pound girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.83,0:29:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 地球上的大嘴怪都认识我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, every chomper on earth knows our face.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.00,0:29:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜这楼里会有多少大嘴怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many do you think are in that building?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.12,0:29:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们连大厅都过不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wouldn't make it past the lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.88,0:29:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.90,0:29:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我就是不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean I got to be happy about.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.31,0:29:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,派个美眉校探去办事\N{\fnArial\fs30}sending in freaking Veronica Mars.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.58,0:29:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be fine…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.68,0:29:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我们就冲进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we'll go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.45,0:29:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,能冲多远冲多远 这才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get as far as we can. Damn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.85,0:29:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.14,0:29:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正把挖掘相关的全部文件发给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sending you all the flagged dig files now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.83,0:29:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 你真是个天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, you are a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.80,0:30:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 真没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. It's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.47,0:30:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.41,0:30:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 皮特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Pete!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.00,0:30:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们都急着交差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we're both on deadline, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.66,0:30:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,进展如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.74,0:30:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.31,0:30:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,过几个小时我就能把完整的进程报告给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you a full progress report in a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.54,0:30:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.89,0:30:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别迟了 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit that deadline, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.72,0:30:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,要什么就告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, holler if you need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.04,0:30:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys, you still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.21,0:30:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.50,0:30:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的经理过来了 他是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, just my manager, the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.39,0:30:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.14,0:30:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我得装成没事人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. I got to act normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.82,0:30:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉他我在工作 传完文件再说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him I was working. Let's just finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.49,0:30:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.50,0:30:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来迪克几天前停手不挖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like Dick stopped digging days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.77,0:30:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.99,0:30:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他找到了他要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess he found what he was looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.18,0:30:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能查查吗 - 早开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you check? - Way ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.78,0:30:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在看出行记录和花费\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking at travel reports, expenses…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.54,0:30:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.89,0:31:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,上周从伊朗发来一个手提箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something in his suitcase left Iran last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.88,0:31:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去三天一直用装甲车和私人飞机运送\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spent the last 72 hours in armored cars and private planes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.02,0:31:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管这是什么 今晚迪克就去收货了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is, it's coming here for Dick tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.99,0:31:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这是什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, w-what the hell is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.54,0:31:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 但他很迫切想拿到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Whatever it is, he wants it bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.89,0:31:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就要拿到它 没得说\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means we got to grab it, end of story.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.60,0:31:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机会在附近私人机场降落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's landing at a private airport near here …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.65,0:31:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 就是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap … right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.87,0:31:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他差人去拿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A courier's set to pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.01,0:31:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,确切的降落时间是多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the exact landing time?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.13,0:31:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,42分钟后 你们来得及吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}42 minutes. Can you make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.89,0:31:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can try.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.89,0:31:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 查理 还有件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, all right, Charlie, one more favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.10,0:31:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,做完赶快出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then get the hell out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.29,0:31:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.78,0:31:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一拿到箱子就会给我电话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'll call as soon as the package is in hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.42,0:31:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我在等了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely. I'm here waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.45,0:31:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我还能去吃点零食\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I've got time for a light snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.40,0:31:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.73,0:31:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正想找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hoping I'd find you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.01,0:32:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. - Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.72,0:32:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.22,0:32:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找这个已经找了很久很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been looking for this for a very, very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.55,0:33:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会是谁干的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, who could have done that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.80,0:33:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他差人去拿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A courier's set to pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.18,0:33:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 确切的降落时间是多少 - 42分钟后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the exact landing time? - 42 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.59,0:33:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们来得及吗 - 尽量吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you make it? - We can try.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.18,0:33:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 查理 还有件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, all right, Charlie, one more favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.59,0:33:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,做完赶快出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then get the hell out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.73,0:33:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你需要什么 - 拖延的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you need? - More time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.77,0:33:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让我争取更多的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let's get you some.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.93,0:33:15.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（紧急货物延迟）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.65,0:33:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅行部在给迪克发邮件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Travel department's e-mailing Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.56,0:33:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,手提箱还在路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suitcase still en route,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.96,0:33:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是受天气影响 会晚到三十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}but diverted by weather and will be 30 minutes late.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.03,0:33:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把关于你们的内容从硬盘里清除\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll finish mopping you guys off the drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.28,0:33:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就闪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get the hell out of dodge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.64,0:33:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全后打给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call us when you're clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.88,0:33:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了边境给你们发短信 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Text you from the border, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.51,0:33:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. - Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.45,0:33:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.36,0:34:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.47,0:34:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正想找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hoping I'd find you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.59,0:34:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 罗曼先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, hey, Mr. Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.35,0:34:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么生疏 喊我迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.37,0:34:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮特 我们没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete, we're good here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.13,0:34:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去吃点东西吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go grab a bite?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.01,0:34:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我看看你找到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me what you found.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.20,0:34:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.17,0:34:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们拿到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what we've won.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.37,0:34:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…是不是就偷了一大块红黏土\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we just…steal a-a hunk of red clay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.42,0:34:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.23,0:34:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先逃出几千里再想这个问题吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we answer that a few thousand miles away from here, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.52,0:35:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理在哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.17,0:35:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么和我公司有关的内容吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there's nothing about my company?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.99,0:35:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那萨姆或是迪恩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a Sam or a Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.90,0:35:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 你说谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, who?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.76,0:35:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆和迪恩 温彻斯特两兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.88,0:35:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,查查看 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it a little peek, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.98,0:35:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克·罗曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.95,0:35:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 姑娘就在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. The girl's right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.05,0:35:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑考虑她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worry about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.28,0:35:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我感觉有问题 还是这里温度骤降了十度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it me, or did it just drop 10 degrees in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.81,0:35:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有点冷飕飕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bit nippy, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.95,0:35:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让维修部门检修空调\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have maintenance check the A.C.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.33,0:35:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让你冻着了 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't have you cold, now, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.59,0:35:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个可悲的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You miserable…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.65,0:35:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 鲍比 别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Bobby, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.55,0:35:43.22,Note,0,0,0,0,,（无匹配对象）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.84,0:35:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有关于温彻斯特兄弟的内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing about those Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.66,0:35:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果硬盘上的东西被删除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If items were deleted from the drive,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.98,0:35:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能看出来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}would you be able to tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.81,0:35:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果删得好就看不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if they were deleted properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.70,0:35:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很狡猾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're crafty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.09,0:36:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,把所有数据发给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have all the data sent to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.47,0:36:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.97,0:36:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 你怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, really, how did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.35,0:36:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.87,0:36:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你攻下了不破之坚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You broke the unbreakable.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.59,0:36:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the thought process?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.77,0:36:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说说 不许说行话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walk me through it, and ix-nay the jargon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.61,0:36:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么是不可攻破的 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…nothing's unbreakable, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.63,0:36:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,滴水石穿 没什么是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's safe if you poke at it long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.53,0:36:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么是安全的 我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's safe. I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.17,0:36:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你这是答非所问啊 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that isn't what I'm asking, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.12,0:36:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的灵气 是万里挑一的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your spark … it's one in a million.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.08,0:36:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 人一旦有了灵气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, but when you got it,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.42,0:36:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,能发明枪 iPad和病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}you invent guns and iPads and viruses,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.77,0:36:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,能变得相当聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, holy crap, you can be crafty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.54,0:36:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 这到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that, Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.02,0:36:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以把你脑子里的东西都喂给别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I can feed every fact in your brain to someone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.67,0:36:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还是不能像你这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}they still wouldn't be able to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.43,0:36:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大概是无法复制的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you can't clone me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.93,0:36:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可真让我生气呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't think that doesn't piss me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.66,0:36:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.88,0:36:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 带到我办公室来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fantastic. Bring it up to my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.55,0:36:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.23,0:37:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're on to something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.99,0:37:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这里 我马上就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here, will you? I'll be back in two shakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.54,0:37:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来还真没什么是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing is safe, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.10,0:37:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻封锁大楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock the building down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.84,0:37:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跑啊 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on there, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.45,0:38:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 他也是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, he's one of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.99,0:38:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就说得通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would explain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.19,0:38:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 你跟错人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hanging with the wrong crowd, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.95,0:38:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别急啊 迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so fast, Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.48,0:38:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 够了 出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, enough! Show yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.73,0:38:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,像真正的怪物那样干一架吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this like real monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.23,0:38:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次啊 真痒痒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to do that again. That tickled.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.07,0:38:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, come on. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.10,0:39:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 跟我们说话 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, talk to us. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.92,0:39:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.43,0:39:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么没杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.73,0:39:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们现在还杀不了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause we can't yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.89,0:39:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们一定会杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.63,0:39:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀大Boss总得用特别武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The really evil ones always need a special sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.27,0:39:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我现在要晕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay. I'm gonna pass out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.55,0:39:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们拿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.29,0:39:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们弄明白是怎么回事之前拿回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now get it back, before they figure the damn thing out!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.17,0:39:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了先生 别逼我自噬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, sir, d-don't bid me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.87,0:39:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,自噬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bid you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.43,0:39:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干嘛要浪费一顿美餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I waste a perfectly good meal?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.45,0:39:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.65,0:39:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我把那个破瓶子扔在后座了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left your dumb flask on the backseat, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.34,0:39:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,最差劲的幸运符了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worst good-luck charm ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.33,0:39:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.56,0:39:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.53,0:40:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 我们对你的感激之情无以言表\N{\fnArial\fs30}So listen, um, we can't thank you enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.10,0:40:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实你们可以表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.88,0:40:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不要再找我了 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never contact me again, like, ever. Deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.17,0:40:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.89,0:40:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,低调点 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your head down out there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.97,0:40:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不是第一次销声匿迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't the first time I've disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.26,0:40:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我真名就是查理·布兰博利\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think my name is really Charlie Bradbury?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.02,0:40:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.97,0:40:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救世界的人 祝你们好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, good luck saving the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.31,0:40:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见啦 贱人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace out, bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.15,0:40:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有点像我永远也不想要的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's kind of like the little sister I never wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.84,0:40:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.31,0:40:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说趁现在没有鬼在旁边吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you mean before we get back to the car and the flask?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.63,0:40:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.30,0:40:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,在大厅里到底发生了什么 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what the hell happened back in the lobby, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.34,0:40:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 如果我有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, if I had a free shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.07,0:40:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,也会痛扁迪克一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have bitch-slapped the hell out of Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.67,0:40:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但是 查理手臂受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but, I mean, Charlie got her freaking arm broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.93,0:40:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't mean to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.92,0:40:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.86,0:40:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他失控了 不是因为迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not in control, not about Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.04,0:40:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,怨魂就是这个样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was vengeful-spirit crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.49,0:40:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但他还是鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. But it's still Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.47,0:41:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果他真的走到这一步 他就不再是他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if he really goes there, he won't be anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.09,0:41:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也不能把他拉回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we won't be able to pull him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.23,0:41:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们要怎么办呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then what are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.51,0:41:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.26,0:41:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先搞清楚偷来的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, let's just figure out what that thing we stole is,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.19,0:41:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再去想怎么处理鲍比的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we'll figure out what the hell to do with Bobby.
